    "body": "Let me try to restate it:\r\n\r\n1. A document is parsed and a custom element name is encountered. Upgrading it fails so its custom element state is not \"custom\".\r\n2. Then this element is inserted again at some point. At this point upgrade is attempted again.\r\n\r\nThe question is whether we should continue trying to upgrade each time this element is inserted, or use the custom element state \"failed\" to take another path there.",
